Subject: [PATCH 09/15] SD Erlang s_groups: name operations and merges read the
 partition inside the group lock

---
 lib/kernel/src/s_group.erl | 43 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---------
 1 file changed, 33 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

